WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.748
Welcome to the Nazareth School Store.

2
00:00:03.748 --> 00:00:12.399
This short video shows you, step by step, how to buy books and uniforms for your child, using your phone.

3
00:00:12.399 --> 00:00:13.635
Take your time.

4
00:00:13.635 --> 00:00:16.601
You can pause the video at any step.

5
00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:19.513
Step 1.

6
00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:22.838
Open the school website on your phone.

7
00:00:22.838 --> 00:00:28.176
At the top of the page, tap the red button that says Sign in.

8
00:00:30.476 --> 00:00:31.123
Step 2.

9
00:00:31.123 --> 00:00:34.270
You will now see the sign in page.

10
00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:37.786
Make sure the word Parent is selected.

11
00:00:40.086 --> 00:00:40.739
Step 3.

12
00:00:40.739 --> 00:00:46.714
In the first box, type your phone number, or your email address.

13
00:00:46.714 --> 00:00:50.262
In the second box, type your password.

14
00:00:50.262 --> 00:00:53.250
Then tap the red Sign in button.

15
00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:56.084
Step 4.

16
00:00:56.084 --> 00:00:57.840
This is your home page.

17
00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:06.697
You will see each of your children, with their class, and how much of their school booklist you have already bought.

18
00:01:08.997 --> 00:01:09.532
Step 5.

19
00:01:09.532 --> 00:01:15.031
The quickest way to shop is the red button that says Buy what's missing.

20
00:01:15.031 --> 00:01:20.530
One tap puts every booklist item you have not bought yet into your cart.

21
00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:24.731
Your wallet credit is also shown here, if you have any.

22
00:01:27.031 --> 00:01:27.714
Step 6.

23
00:01:27.714 --> 00:01:35.129
If you prefer to choose items yourself, tap Shop for, and your child's name.

24
00:01:37.429 --> 00:01:38.032
Step 7.

25
00:01:38.032 --> 00:01:42.001
At the top you will see your child's booklist.

26
00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:46.142
Tap Add full booklist to add everything at once.

27
00:01:46.142 --> 00:01:50.369
For uniforms, you will be asked to choose a size.

28
00:01:52.669 --> 00:01:53.295
Step 8.

29
00:01:53.295 --> 00:02:01.254
To buy only some items, scroll down and tap Add for your child, under each item you want.

30
00:02:03.554 --> 00:02:04.108
Step 9.

31
00:02:04.108 --> 00:02:09.729
When you have finished choosing, tap Cart at the bottom of your screen.

32
00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:13.925
The red number shows how many items are in your cart.

33
00:02:16.225 --> 00:02:16.864
Step 10.

34
00:02:16.864 --> 00:02:18.941
Check your cart carefully.

35
00:02:18.941 --> 00:02:22.696
Make sure the items and the prices are correct.

36
00:02:22.696 --> 00:02:30.205
Use the plus and minus buttons to change the number, or tap the small cross to remove an item.

37
00:02:32.505 --> 00:02:33.290
Step 11.

38
00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:38.294
When your cart is correct, tap Continue to payment.

39
00:02:40.594 --> 00:02:41.269
Step 12.

40
00:02:41.269 --> 00:02:50.643
If you have credit in your wallet, for example from an item you returned, it is taken off first, automatically.

41
00:02:50.643 --> 00:02:52.838
You only pay what is left.

42
00:02:55.138 --> 00:02:55.874
Step 13.

43
00:02:55.874 --> 00:03:00.195
Tap the red button that says Pay with Paystack.

44
00:03:00.195 --> 00:03:03.780
It shows exactly how much you will pay.

45
00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:06.930
Step 14.

46
00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.587
Tap Continue to Paystack.

47
00:03:09.587 --> 00:03:18.618
On Paystack's safe page, pay with your card, your bank app, a bank transfer, or USSD.

48
00:03:20.918 --> 00:03:21.549
Step 15.

49
00:03:21.549 --> 00:03:26.124
When the payment is done, you will see Payment successful.

50
00:03:26.124 --> 00:03:31.723
Your order is approved straight away, and the school starts packing it.

51
00:03:34.023 --> 00:03:34.653
Step 16.

52
00:03:34.653 --> 00:03:38.429
You will get a message when your order is ready.

53
00:03:38.429 --> 00:03:43.072
Open Orders, and show the pick-up code at the school store.

54
00:03:43.072 --> 00:03:46.691
Anyone you send can collect it with this code.

55
00:03:48.991 --> 00:03:49.938
That is all.

56
00:03:49.938 --> 00:03:57.280
If you cannot buy online, the school store can place the order for you at the school counter.

57
00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:02.253
If you need help, send a WhatsApp message to the school office.

58
00:04:02.253 --> 00:04:03.043
Thank you.

